{"Title":"An Act authorizing the town of Andover to convert a certain parcel of land for general municipal purposes","BillNumber":"S2955","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"BRF0","Name":"Barry R. Finegold","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BRF0","ResponseDate":"2024-09-19T10:36:05.267"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"BRF0","Name":"Barry R. Finegold","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BRF0","ResponseDate":"2024-09-19T10:36:05.2666667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2955/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Senate,  September 23, 2024 - New draft (Senator Finegold) to Senate Bill authorizing the town of Andover to convert a certain parcel of land for general municipal purposes (Senate, No. 2581).","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the town of Andover may use a certain parcel of land acquired by the town for school purposes by a deed recorded in the northern Essex district registry of deeds in book 509, page 278 for general municipal purposes which may include, but shall not be limited to, school and town administrative offices. The parcel shall be under the care, custody and control of the select board.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}